@host = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Lister
GET {{host}}/api/orders

### Lire
GET {{host}}/api/orders/ORD-101

### Créer
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-001

{"customerId":"C102","items":[{"productId":"P12","quantity":2}]}

### Confirmer
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/ORD-101
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CONFIRMED"}

### Annuler
POST {{host}}/api/orders/ORD-102/cancellations

### Disponibilité
GET {{host}}/api/orders/ORD-102/availability

### Diagnostic bloquant
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/blocking

### Diagnostic non bloquant
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics/nonblocking

### Stocks direct
GET http://127.0.0.1:3001/stock/P12
